flowchart LR
    CTG[ClinicalTrials.gov data] --> AACT[(AACT PostgreSQL snapshot\nctgov schema)]
    AACT --> EXTRACT[TrialIQ deterministic extraction]
    EXTRACT --> NORMALIZE[Normalization + canonical identity]
    NORMALIZE --> LOAD[Canonical Neo4j batched load]
    LOAD --> RECON[Scope reconciliation + provenance checks]
    RECON --> NEO[(TrialIQ Neo4j graph)]

    NEO --> QUERY[Bounded TrialIQ graph query]
    QUERY --> EVIDENCE[Graph evidence + source IDs]
    EVIDENCE --> METRICS[Deterministic metrics]
    METRICS --> VALIDATE[Evidence / grounding validation]
    AACT -. field-level source verification .-> VALIDATE
    VALIDATE --> RESULT[Grounded TrialIQ result]
    RESULT --> UI[Investigator Console]
